      *  BANK SELECT FILE FOR EFT/ACH PROCESSING                      *
      *                                                               *
      *  This file is used by ACH/EFT process to include/exclude      *
      *  bank account from processing                                 *
      *                                                               *
      *  CREATED: 06/29/09     PROGRAMMER: 191     PROJECT: WC1806    *
      *****************************************************************
      * REVISIONS:                                                    *
      *                                                               *
      * 05/28/14 C:136 PROJECT: 129WTG                                *
      *                ADD FIELDS FOR IMMED DEST AND FILE NAME        *
      *                                                               *
      * 11/07/13    C:180    SUPPORT 82888                            *
      *                      EFT lock enhancements - Add Job          *
      *****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PCK01                     TEXT('BANK SELECT FILE')
     A            CKCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            CKACCT    R               REFFLD(NM20)
     A                                      COLHDG('BANK ACCT #')
     A            CKINEX    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('INCLUDE' 'EXCLUDE FLAG')
     A            CKUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A****** Begin add  **** 11/07/13 *********************************
     A            CKJOB     R               REFFLD(JOB)
     A****** End   add  **** 11/07/13 *********************************
     A*** BEG ADD ***** 05/28/14 **************************************
     A            CKIDST        10A         COLHDG('Immed Dest')
     A            CKEFTF        10A         COLHDG('EFT Filename')
     A            CKBKNM        40A         COLHDG('Bank Name')
     A            CKBKLT         2S 0       COLHDG('BANK' 'LEAD' 'TIME')
     A            CKSVCL         3S 0       COLHDG('SERV' 'CLASS')
     A*** END ADD ***** 05/28/14 **************************************
